# 📖 TOEIC Grammar - Day 05

## Topic
# Passive Voice (수동태)

---

## Rule

### 능동태

주어가 직접 행동을 한다.

Structure

Subject + Verb + Object

Example

The company released a new product.

(회사가 신제품을 출시했다.)

---

### 수동태

주어가 행동을 당한다.

Structure

Subject + be + Past Participle (p.p.)

Example

The new product was released yesterday.

(신제품이 어제 출시되었다.)

---

## Frequently Used Passive Verbs

- be made
- be completed
- be scheduled
- be required
- be delivered
- be announced

---

## Examples

The meeting was canceled.

The report was completed yesterday.

The package will be delivered tomorrow.

English is spoken all over the world.

---

## TOEIC Tip

수동태 = **be + p.p.**

시험에서 **be동사가 없으면 대부분 오답**인 경우가 많다.
